<title>USA: Mach One Corp says to buy LaserVend.</title>
<headline>Mach One Corp says to buy LaserVend.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mach One Corp said it had signed a letter of intent to buy LaserVend Inc of Orem, Utah.</p>
<p>It did not disclose the terms of the acquisition.</p>
<p>LaserVend makes automated computer software vending and Internet access machines.</p>
